#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:1
msgid "Factor research: from rows to tables"
msgstr "因子研究：从行到表"

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:3
msgid ""
"The factor area turns a prepared panel into IC studies, quantile buckets, "
"tears, artifacts and export tables. This guide follows that path and points "
"out the places where a configuration choice changes the result."
msgstr "因子领域把准备好的面板变成 IC 研究、分位分桶、tears、artifacts 与导出表。本指南沿着这条路径走，并指出配置选择会改变结果的地方。"

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:7
msgid "The input panel"
msgstr "输入面板"

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:9
msgid "`prepared_factor_data` is the only accepted input:"
msgstr "`prepared_factor_data` 是唯一接受的输入："

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"struct prepared_factor_data {\n"
"    std::vector<factor_row> rows;      // retained observations\n"
"    std::vector<std::string> forward_labels;  // labels aligned with row "
"returns\n"
"    factor_loss_report loss_report;    // cleaning-loss accounting\n"
"};\n"
msgstr ""
"struct prepared_factor_data {\n"
"    std::vector<factor_row> rows;      // retained observations\n"
"    std::vector<std::string> forward_labels;  // labels aligned with row "
"returns\n"
"    factor_loss_report loss_report;    // cleaning-loss accounting\n"
"};\n"

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:19
msgid ""
"Each `factor_row` carries a date, an asset, a finite factor value, a one-"
"based quantile label supplied by the caller, an optional group label, and a "
"vector of forward returns **aligned by position with `forward_labels`**. "
"That alignment is the contract: the label order and the per-row vector order"
" must describe the same columns."
msgstr ""
"每个 `factor_row` 携带日期、资产、有限的因子值、由调用方给出一基分位标签、可选的分组标签，以及一个与 `forward_labels` "
"**按位置对齐**的前瞻收益向量。这个对齐就是契约：标签顺序与每行向量顺序必须描述同一批列。"

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:25
msgid "Analysis configuration"
msgstr "分析配置"

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"fincore::factor_analysis_config config;\n"
"config.periods = {\"1D\", \"5D\"};        // must name prepared labels\n"
"config.turnover_periods = {1, 5};     // positive, unique lags\n"
"config.by_group = true;               // needs a group column\n"
"config.include_portfolio_inputs = false;\n"
"const auto model = fincore::analyze_factor(prepared, config);\n"
msgstr ""
"fincore::factor_analysis_config config;\n"
"config.periods = {\"1D\", \"5D\"};        // must name prepared labels\n"
"config.turnover_periods = {1, 5};     // positive, unique lags\n"
"config.by_group = true;               // needs a group column\n"
"config.include_portfolio_inputs = false;\n"
"const auto model = fincore::analyze_factor(prepared, config);\n"

